120
00:09:14.762 --> 00:09:16.127
Thirty-second answer:

121
00:09:16.407 --> 00:09:23.042
PostGIS: a geography column, a GiST index, and STDWithin(location, me, 1000).

122
00:09:23.322 --> 00:09:24.111
Redis:

123
00:09:24.391 --> 00:09:26.119
GEOADD, then GEOSEARCH...

124
00:09:26.399 --> 00:09:27.957
BYRADIUS 1 km.

125
00:09:28.237 --> 00:09:32.695
Internally it's a 52-bit geohash stored as a sorted-set score.

